us":"PUBLISHED"},{"chapterName":"Mathematical Reasoning","difficulty":"HARD","examPattern":"JEE_MAIN","options":[{"content":"$\\text{If the triangle is equilateral, then not all its angles are equal}$","displayOrder":0,"isCorrect":false,"optionKey":"A"},{"content":"$\\text{If all its angles are equal, then the triangle is equilateral}$","displayOrder":1,"isCorrect":false,"optionKey":"B"},{"content":"$\\text{If not the triangle is equilateral, then not all its angles are equal}$","displayOrder":2,"isCorrect":false,"optionKey":"C"},{"content":"$\\text{If not all its angles are equal, then not the triangle is equilateral}$","displayOrder":3,"isCorrect":true,"optionKey":"D"}],"questionContent":"Write the contrapositive of the statement\n\n\"If the triangle is equilateral, then all its angles are equal.\"","questionType":"SINGLE_CORRECT","solutionContent":"The contrapositive of \"if $p$ then $q$\" is \"if not $q$ then not $p$\".\n\nNote this is not the converse, which would be \"if all its angles are equal then the triangle is equilateral\".","status":"PUBLISHED"},{"chapterName":"Mathematical Reasoning","difficulty":"EASY","examPattern":"JEE_MAIN","options":[{"content":"$\\text{If not it is raining, then not the ground is wet}$","displayOrder":0,"isCorrect":false,"optionKey":"A"},{"content":"$\\text{If the ground is wet, then it is raining}$","displayOrder":1,"isCorrect":false,"optionKey":"B"},{"content":"$\\text{If it is raining, then not the ground is wet}$","displayOrder":2,"isCorrect":false,"optionKey":"C"},{"content":"$\\text{If not the ground is wet, then not it is raining}$","displayOrder":3,"isCorrect":true,"optionKey":"D"}],"questionContent":"Write the contrapositive of the statement\n\n\"If it is raining, then the ground is wet.\"","questionType":"SINGLE_CORRECT","solutionContent":"The contrapositive of \"if $p$ then $q$\" is \"if not $q$ then not $p$\".\n\nNote this is not the converse, which would be \"if the ground is wet then it is raining\".","status":"PUB